14. INTELLIGENT PLAYBACK AND EPISODE PROGRESSION

Integrate with the existing bot playback engine.

Do not implement a separate browser-based streaming system.

The expected sequence for a series:

Season 1 Episode 1 → Episode 2 → Episode 3 → Last Episode → Season 2 Episode 1 → Continue until completion.

Use real API episode relationships and validated episode ordering.

Implement next-item preparation through the existing backend's bounded preload pipeline.

The current movie must retain playback priority.

Do not consume excessive disk space or memory.

Use suitable media validation and source compatibility checks before preparing the next stream.

Skip Intro must only use reliable timestamps or administrator-supplied markers.

Never guess movie intro timestamps.

A failed next-item preparation must not interrupt the current movie.

