16. TELEGRAM BOT INTEGRATION

The Mini App must remain tightly connected to the existing bot.

The primary launch flow:

Telegram bot → STREAM MOVIES → Select Destination → Open Mini App.

The selected destination should be loaded automatically.

When the administrator presses PLAY NOW:

1. Confirm the selected destination.
2. Validate the user's permissions.
3. Validate that the bot/streaming account can access the VC.
4. Check whether the destination has an active playback session.
5. Resolve the movie's compatible media source.
6. Prepare the stream through the existing backend.
7. Ask the existing streaming engine to join/start in the appropriate VC.
8. Confirm actual stream startup.
9. Update persistent playback state.
10. Update the public now-playing card.
11. Update every connected administrator dashboard.

Do not show "Playing" merely because an API request was submitted.

Only show successful playback once the real streaming engine confirms it.

The existing PAPPY Rich Message formatter must be reused for the public now-playing cards.

Do not rebuild public Telegram cards as unrelated basic messages.

